2026-06-04 16:27:14.616 DEBUG [trace:] [event:] [module:] --- [   scheduling-1] o.s.jdbc.core.JdbcTemplate               : Executing prepared SQL statement [    insert into analytics.stage_metric_rollup_bucket (
        bucket_start,
        granularity_minutes,
        module_code,
        event_type_code,
        stage_type_code,
        metric_type_code,
        unit,
